          <description>SOURCE[ROM_REV0_PHY_FREQUENCY_CHANNEL,BLOB_LIBPP_HAL_HE_INIT_SUFFIX]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact-partial]. Canonical multifunction PHY/MAC word. Complete phy_mac_tx_chan_offset and phy_bb_cbw_chan_cfg update the low channel-offset field; complete hal_set_tx_min_pwr updates bits 9:4 and the HE init parent independently sets bit 17.</description>
