              <description>SOURCE[BLOB_LIBPHY_PHY_DEBUG_I2C]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact]. Logical PHY-I2C block ID. The bank host and valid half-open register-index ranges are: SAR1 host 0 [0,7), ULP host 1 [0,11), RFPLL host 1 [0,22), RFPLL_SDM host 1 [0,7), BBPLL host 0 [0,11), BBTOP host 1 [0,57), PERIF host 0 [0,13), BIAS host 1 [0,4), TXRF host 1 [1,22), DIG_REG host 0 [0,15).</description>
