    <peripheral>
      <name>WIFI_MAC_BEAMFORMING_FEEDBACK_TEST</name>
      <description>SOURCE[BLOB_LIBPP_TEST_BF_SET_FEEDBACK]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact-partial]. Test-only beamforming-feedback selector written by complete esp_test_bf_set_feedback. The write transforms and selector branches are exact; the public meaning of selector values zero through sixteen is not present in the archive, so only bounded functional names are assigned.</description>
