      <description>SOURCE[BLOB_LIBPP_HAL_HE_OBSS_NARROW_BAND_RU]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact-partial]. Complete hal_he_disable_obss_narrow_bw_ru writes either all ones or zero into the twenty-bit bitmap and independently sets or clears a five-bit class group and the global disable bit. The leaf name proves the aggregate disable function; individual bitmap/class identities remain approximate.</description>
