          <name>HE_SCRATCH%s</name>
          <description>SOURCE[BLOB_LIBPP_HAL_HE_INIT_SUFFIX,BLOB_LIBPP_DBG_READ_TX_MPLEN,BLOB_LIBPP_MAC_TX_SET_TB,ROM_REV0_MAC_TX_SET_TB]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact]. Parent clears 120 consecutive words from 0x201055f0 through 0x201057cc. Complete dbg_read_tx_mplen reads the same aperture as the hardware TX MPDU-length link table and names bits 13:0 MPDU_LEN and bits 20:14 NEXT. Complete mac_tx_set_mplen preserves bits 31:21, writes the fourteen-bit DMA metadata length (plus four when metadata word one bit 28 is set), and links contiguous allocated entries; the terminal entry uses NEXT=0x7f.</description>
