          <description>SOURCE[BLOB_LIBPP_HAL_TSF_TIMER]; CONFIDENCE[instruction-exact]. Full 32-bit timer target written by hal_tsf_timer_set_target and returned through the first output pointer by hal_tsf_timer_get_target.</description>
