      <source id="BLOB_LIBPP_HAL_PWR">_oracles/libpp.a sha256 f863c65c3ed89cf5d2a2cbe0d6bca3b783ca35788a704bb68e13958e4b94958e; complete hal_pwr.o modem-power leaves from pwr_hal_set_mac_modem_beacon_miss_timeout size 0x18 through pwr_hal_set_mac_modem_tbtt_auto_period_interval size 0x20. The promoted fields are limited to complete no-call RMW bodies at 0x2010d834, 0x2010d838, 0x2010d83c, 0x2010d854 and 0x2010d858.</source>
      <source id="BLOB_LIBPP_HAL_HE_SET_MMSS_AND_AID">_oracles/libpp.a sha256 f863c65c3ed89cf5d2a2cbe0d6bca3b783ca35788a704bb68e13958e4b94958e; complete hal_mac_ctl.o hal_he_set_mmss_and_aid body, size 0x82.</source>
      <source id="BLOB_LIBPP_HAL_HE_BSSID_LIFECYCLE">_oracles/libpp.a sha256 f863c65c3ed89cf5d2a2cbe0d6bca3b783ca35788a704bb68e13958e4b94958e; complete hal_mac_ctl.o hal_he_bssid_init size 0x4c, hal_he_bssid_deinit size 0x1e and hal_he_set_power_save size 0x36. Interface-zero init performs four ordered fresh-read RMW edges: set WDEV_HE_BSSID0_CONF bit 31, clear bits 30:29, set WDEV_RX_POWER_SAVE_CONF bit 29, then set bit 28. _oracles/libnet80211.a sha256 92550813de20ed0d51110dbd72b646e891a86a8a2f81fa53714ebf2ebf9c8f; complete wl_cnx.o cnx_connect_to_bss size 0x2b6 calls interface-zero init after associated-STA receive policy when the peer and cipher admit HE, before clearing the color bitmap and calling hal_he_set_bss_color.</source>
      <source id="HIL_OPEN_HE_BSSID_LIFECYCLE_2026_07_30">../esp32s31_rust/firmware/esp32s31/app/src/open_radio_phy_prelude_hil.rs on ESP32-S31 rev0, open PHY/MAC, standard psram-code-psram-data profile and controlled HE20 AP, 2026-07-30. After association, WPA2/CCMP, TID0 AddBA and sustained 32-MPDU HE MCS9 transmission, typed PAC diagnostics read HE_BSSID_ENABLE=1, BSSID_SELECT=0, INTRA_PPDU_PS_ENABLE=1 and INTRA_PS_CHECK_BSS_COLOR_ENABLE=1. The AP advertised disabled BSS color 0x99, so BSS_COLOR_ENABLE correctly remained zero.</source>
      <source id="BLOB_LIBNET80211_IEEE80211_PARSE_HECAP">_oracles/libnet80211.a sha256 92550813de20ed0d51110dbd72b646e891a86a8a2f81fa53714ebf2ebf9c8f40; complete ieee80211_he.o ieee80211_parse_hecap body, size 0x2d8, including nominal-packet-padding extraction.</source>
      <source id="BLOB_LIBPP_DBG_READ_TX_PPDU">_oracles/libpp.a sha256 f863c65c3ed89cf5d2a2cbe0d6bca3b783ca35788a704bb68e13958e4b94958e; complete hal_debug.o dbg_read_tx_ppdu body, size 0x3b6, and its pinned format strings. The decoder names frame-state halfword offset 0x22 msdu_len; complete mac_tx_set_tb independently sums that exact halfword into WDEVTXQBSR_SW.</source>
      <source id="ROM_REV0_PHY_DAC_SCALE_SET">_oracles/esp32s31_rev0_rom.elf sha256 a52ad7513deb656a910a5740125f1cce2c7941f11ce57213b7b43aea93d5ab87; complete phy_dac_scale_set at 0x2f82873a, size 0x3c.</source>
